  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-02-02",
   "text": "Essential Pay for Essential Workers Act\n This bill requires employers to pay essential health care employees a premium amount in addition to their regular rate of pay during an emergency period. It also allows employers a payroll tax credit for the payment of such enhanced wages to essential employees."
  }
